  "body": "The known two-term action complex does not evaluate the unrestricted polynomial-functor decomposition requested by Petersen. This package records that reduction, the credited cyclic-Lie layer, and the correctly sign-twisted translation of Powell's recent low-degree theorem, with the remaining Schur kernels stated explicitly.\n\nThe full target remains unresolved, and no novelty claim is made. Independent adversarial review passed for this partial scope. The author receipt reproduced exactly; nine independently constructed exterior-action matrices and three character identities passed exact checks.\n\nAll changes are confined to the problem's attempt directory, including the frozen partial note, source provenance, research log, checks and independent review.\n",
